      192.57,
      203.93,
      371.13,
      228.59
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE PARLIAMENTARY ELECTIONSACT, NO. 1 OF 1981",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      244.13,
      401.91,
      268.79
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      284.33,
      401.89,
      308.99
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as Parliamentary Elections(Amendment) Act, No. of 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      324.53,
      401.88,
      389.39
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 7 of the Parliamentary Elections Act,No. 1 of 1981 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d as amended by Act, No. 58 of 2009, is herebyfurther amended by the repeal of subsection 4(d) andsubstitution thereof, with the following:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      197.13,
      404.93,
      401.89,
      496.67
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(d)In order to guarantee better representation ofwomen in political parties and in politics,every recognized political party shall ensurethe inclusion of not less than thirty per centumof women office bearers, in a decision makingcapacity, in the list of office bearers of suchparty.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      511.13,
      401.9,
      534.47
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      325.03,
      455.86,
      401.3
    ],
    "text": "Amendmentof Section 7of theParliamentaryElectionsAct,No. 1 of1981",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      512.71,
      455.14,
      550.58
    ],
    "text": "Sinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
